# Afterburner — developer route plan
R until x>=44.5             # full speed on the gel
RJ until grounded           # clear the pit
R until x>=70
R B:74.5,29.2 for 1         # magenta on the floor under the ledge
R until x>=90
R A:118.95,28.5 for 1       # cyan on the end wall at floor level
R until tele                # into the wall at gel speed, out of the floor going up
L until finished
